  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamwanta Hezekiya wekumi nakawana, mwanta wakuAshuri Senakeribi wenjili nakulwa nanyi kala yawaYuda yamapwembu yejima, hakuyitambula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wakuAshuri hakutemesha Rabishake hakufuma kuLakishi hakuya kudi mwanta Hezekiya kuYerusalema nanjita yeneni. Hakwimana kukapila kakwijiya dakundundamu kumukwakwawakwiha damukwakukosa mahina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi yena hikukwinza mwana kaHilikiya Eliyakimi, wadiŋa mukulumpi wawakwetala, ninsoneki Shebina, ni mwana kaAsafwi Yowa, mukwakusoneka nsaŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabishake hakuyila nindi, Kamwilenu dinu Hezekiya, nenu, Mwanta muneni, mwantawa kuAshuri nindi, Wunaditembi chumanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami, Omu muwukuhosha neyi, Nakwati dehi mpùŋa, niŋovu yakwasa njita tudi nayu, himazu amukanwa hohu. Wunakuhwelelinyi mwaka wudikaŋi nanami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma nawuna kuhweleli Ejipitu, mukombu weteti dachikeka; mukombu wakwilamuntu wukwila nindi ashilamenuhu, hiwukwijila muchikasa chindi hiwukumulemeka? Dichi chelaŋayi Fwaro mwanta wakuEjipitu antu ejima amukuhwelelaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wukuŋila neyi, Tunakuhweleli Yehova Nzambi yetu, hidiyi wukweti yinaŋa anaŋa nitumeŋa twanafumishiyi Hezekiya, hakuyila aYuda nawakwaYerusalema nindi, Chiŋa mwakadifukulaŋa kumesu akameŋa akaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu mwani, mwinkenu nkaka yami mwanta wakuAshuri kapopu, ninami nakakwinka tuwalu makombakaji ayedi, neyi eyi wunatwcshi kweyi kushahu akwakwendelahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyiwukukapanya kutemuna nikachilolu kamu kawambuŋankaka yami akehelamu, yeyi kwaamu wukukuhwelela aEjipitu neyi akwinki makálu nawakwatuwalu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinenzi nakujilumuna mukaliwu, komana nenzi kanka wamichakadi Yehova? Yehova diyi naŋili nindi, Yaku wakaasi ituŋidi wakadijilumini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliyakimi naShebina naYowa hiyakumwila Rabishake, nawu, Atuhoshimwani, etu ambuŋeyi, mwidimi daSiriya, muloŋa twadiluka. Bayi atuhoshamwidimi dawaYudeya kumatu awantu adi hampwembuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabishake nindi, Komana mwanta wami nantemeshi kudi mwanta weyi, hela kudeyi, kulonda nihoshi mazu awa? Hanantemeshi kudi antu ashakama hampwembu kulonda akadyi tuji twawu, akanwi masu awu hamu naneyuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabishake hakwimana, hakubidika nezu daŊovu mwidimi dawaYudeya, nindi, Tiyenu izu damwanta muneni, mwanta wakuAshuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwantanindi, Bayi ayidimba kudi Hezekiyaku; muloŋa yena hakatwesha kuyipulwishaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya bayi ayileja kukuhwelela Yehova, nindi, Yehova chalala wakatupulwisha, nimukala iwu hiyakawuhana kudi mwanta wakuAshuruku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mutiyilila Hezekiyaku, muloŋa mwanta wakuAshuri nindi, Tudikundejenu, mwidiki mwinzi kudami; mwakadyaŋa wejima wenunyivinyu yenu, wejima wenu yikuyu yenu, mwakanwaŋa wejima wenu meji akumashima enu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nichinakenza nakuyifumishamu nakayitwali kwituŋa dafwana neyi ituŋa denwenu aweni, ituŋa datidiku navinyu, ituŋa damankendina matempa anyivinyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babalenu akenza kayikanjikŋa kudi Hezekiya, nindi, Yehova wukutupulwishaku. Kuduhu akishi anyuza anapulwishi matuŋawu kudi mwanta wakuAshuri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akishi akuHamati nakuAripadi adi kudihi? Akishi aSefwavwayimi adi kudihi? Ayipulwisha aSamariya kudami tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akishi ejima amumatuŋa hanamwekani mukishinyi napulwishi ituŋa dawu kudami, mwaka Yehova akapulwishi Yerusalema kudami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu hiyakudimwenena kwawu zo-o, kumwakulaizu nidimu nehi; muloŋa mwanta wayileja dehi nindi, Bayi amwakulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaHilikiya Eliyakimi wadiŋa mukulumpi wawakwetala, ninsoneki Shebina, ni mwana kaAsafwi Yowa mukwakusoneka nsaŋu, hiyakwinza kudi Hezekiya namahina akutabola, hiyakumuleja mazu aRabishake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.36.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
